&lt;p>&lt;strong>本文边界&lt;/strong>：本文聚焦业务入口 TLS、证书 Secret 与 cert-manager 的协作；Ingress 资源和 Ingress Controller 的路由模型请阅读入口专题。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>推荐深读&lt;/strong>：&lt;a href="./Ingress%20%e8%af%a6%e8%a7%a3%ef%bc%9aKubernetes%20%e9%9b%86%e7%be%a4%e7%9a%84%22%e6%99%ba%e8%83%bd%e4%ba%a4%e9%80%9a%e6%8c%87%e6%8c%a5%e4%b8%ad%e5%bf%83%22.md">Ingress 详解：Kubernetes 集群的&amp;quot;智能交通指挥中心&amp;quot;&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>什么时候用 Service，什么时候用 Deployment</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%94%A8-Service%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%94%A8-Deployment/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%94%A8-Service%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E7%94%A8-Deployment/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
