&lt;p>&lt;strong>推荐深读&lt;/strong>：&lt;a href="./Deployment%20%e8%af%a6%e8%a7%a3%ef%bc%9aKubernetes%20%e9%9b%86%e7%be%a4%e7%9a%84%22%e5%ba%94%e7%94%a8%e9%83%a8%e7%bd%b2%e6%8e%a7%e5%88%b6%e5%99%a8%22.md">Deployment 详解：Kubernetes 集群的&amp;quot;应用部署控制器&amp;quot;&lt;/a> 与 &lt;a href="./rollout%20%e4%b8%8e%20rolling%20update%20%e7%9a%84%e5%8c%ba%e5%88%ab.md">rollout 与 rolling update 的区别&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>rollout 与 rolling update 的区别</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/rollout-%E4%B8%8E-rolling-update-%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/rollout-%E4%B8%8E-rolling-update-%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>本文边界&lt;/strong>：本文聚焦发布过程、&lt;code>rollout&lt;/code> 操作与 &lt;code>RollingUpdate&lt;/code> 策略的区别；Deployment 的资源模型及 Service/Deployment 的选型边界请阅读配套文章。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>推荐深读&lt;/strong>：&lt;a href="./Deployment%20%e8%af%a6%e8%a7%a3%ef%bc%9aKubernetes%20%e9%9b%86%e7%be%a4%e7%9a%84%22%e5%ba%94%e7%94%a8%e9%83%a8%e7%bd%b2%e6%8e%a7%e5%88%b6%e5%99%a8%22.md">Deployment 详解：Kubernetes 集群的&amp;quot;应用部署控制器&amp;quot;&lt;/a> 与 &lt;a href="./%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%97%b6%e5%80%99%e7%94%a8%20Service%ef%bc%8c%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%97%b6%e5%80%99%e7%94%a8%20Deployment.md">什么时候用 Service，什么时候用 Deployment&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Service 转发链路：从 ClusterIP 到 EndpointSlice 与 kube-proxy</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Service-%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E4%BB%8E-ClusterIP-%E5%88%B0-EndpointSlice-%E4%B8%8E-kube-proxy/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Service-%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E4%BB%8E-ClusterIP-%E5%88%B0-EndpointSlice-%E4%B8%8E-kube-proxy/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
