&lt;p>&lt;code>NetworkPolicy&lt;/code> 是 Kubernetes 里用于控制 Pod 网络访问的资源对象。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Calico 流量走向：BGP、IPIP、VXLAN 与 eBPF</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Calico-%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91BGPIPIPVXLAN-%E4%B8%8E-eBPF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Calico-%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91BGPIPIPVXLAN-%E4%B8%8E-eBPF/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
