&lt;p>Pod 是短生命周期资源。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Kubernetes 网络与运行时选型速记</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Kubernetes-%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/Kubernetes-%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
